A field the new version removes from a struct the lens does not write, so
that the rest of the struct is copied: the drop the help offers nests the
field in its struct, as CUE writes it.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	meta: {
		owner: string
		note:  string
	}
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	meta: {
		owner: string
	}
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		id: v0_0.id
	}
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	meta: {
		owner: string
	}
}
-- out/error --
error[E0347]: v0.0 declares meta.note and v1.0 does not, and nothing maps it
 --> history/1.0.thema:8:1
  |
8 | ForwardLens: {
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: write <field>: v0_0.meta.note to move it, or meta: {note: _drop}
